      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Asking people to select the amount of bits to allocate to a variable seems a bit too technical. Instead I'd propose that you define the minimum and maximum value and the SDK selects the appropriate type for you.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
